{"id":"0add3b79bdedfb49","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-derived-model.md","title":"Derived Model Theorem","display":"thm-derived-model — Derived Model Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-derived-model","aliases":["58-thm-derived-model"],"display":"thm-derived-model — Derived Model Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-derived-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-derived-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-derived-model — Derived Model Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74261e48e94a4d06\" href=\"?note=74261e48e94a4d06\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model\">58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*\">\\(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*\\)</span> are the derived-model data in the ambient collapse extension</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)\\)</span> is the canonical class-schema predicate: it includes that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> is a limit of Woodin cardinals, identifies the Levy collapse and external generic, and constructs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^*\">\\(\\mathbb R^*\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^*\">\\(\\Gamma^*\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\lambda\">\\(D_\\lambda\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74261e48e94a4d06\" href=\"?note=74261e48e94a4d06\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model\">58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AD}^+\">\\(\\mathrm{AD}^+\\)</span> denote the corresponding axiom systems in the external class metatheory</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}derived\\text{-}model}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)\n\\longrightarrow\nD_\\lambda\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathrm{AD}^{+}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}derived\\text{-}model}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)\n\\longrightarrow\nD_\\lambda\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathrm{AD}^{+}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The antecedent is delegated to the canonical derived-model atom instead of duplicating it with unregistered predicates such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivedPointclass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivedPointclass}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Both ambient genericity and satisfaction by the possibly proper inner-model class are explicitly metatheoretic.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model","status":"resolved","id":"74261e48e94a4d06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model","status":"resolved","id":"74261e48e94a4d06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)$ is the canonical class-schema predicate: it includes that $\\lambda$ is a limit of Woodin cardinals, identifies the Levy collapse and external generic, and constructs $\\mathbb R^*$, $\\Gamma^*$, and $D_\\lambda$ (see [[58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^*","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AD}^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}derived\\text{-}model}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S(D_\\lambda,\\lambda,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)\n\\longrightarrow\nD_\\lambda\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathrm{AD}^{+}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DerivedPointclass}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1390,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-derived-model.md|58-thm-derived-model]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["74261e48e94a4d06"]}